OL,3,GNEWSAPolice watchdog issues workload
OL,4,Awarning as high-level case load soars
OL,5,
OL,6,FScotland's policing commissioner has
OL,7,Fwarned that high-level investigations,
OL,8,Fincluding deaths in custody, are taking
OL,9,Flonger due to a soaring case load.
OL,11,FLaura Paton, the Police Investigations
OL,12,Fand Review Commissioner (Pirc), said
OL,13,Fthe record level of demand was
OL,14,Fjeopardising her ability to help
OL,15,Fdeliver justice on behalf of
OL,16,Fcommunities.
OL,18,FLatest figures show the organisation is
OL,19,Fmanaging 191 investigations, including
OL,20,F49 deaths.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,425,420,260,160,0,100
